WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.800
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.984
AI and machine learning can affect

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:11.944
every part of society.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:14.344
For instance, self-driving cars use AI

00:00:14.344 --> 00:00:17.784
to recognize their surroundings, track objects,

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.968
and make super important decisions,

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:20.968
like when to stop.

00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:27.008
Machine learning is already being used in some really amazing things.

00:00:28.168 --> 00:00:29.953
It's allowing us to be more energy

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:35.193
efficient. We use it to improve how we grow food and manage natural resources.

00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:39.913
It's dramatically changing how we diagnose diseases and create new

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:44.953
medicines. It's even helping the blind see.

00:00:44.953 --> 00:00:48.953
I think it's a man jumping in the air doing a trick on a skateboard.

00:00:49.922 --> 00:00:53.922
But there are also risks.

00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:58.242
Consider the potential impact when machine learning is used to evaluate candidates for

00:00:58.242 --> 00:00:59.907
college admission,

00:00:59.907 --> 00:01:04.627
screen applicants for bank loans, or even predict crime or spot criminals.

00:01:05.827 --> 00:01:09.667
When using machine learnings in these types of applications, we need to make sure

00:01:09.891 --> 00:01:14.891
not to use prejudice training data that would perpetuate human bias.

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:19.876
As AI and machine learning change everything,

00:01:19.876 --> 00:01:22.876
it's important that you have a hand in how they're being used.

00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:29.860
More than any other technology, AI has the potential to revolutionize our lives for the better,

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.760
so long as it's done in a way that avoids bias that could cause harm or inequity.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.960
The most important thing about machine learning is human learning.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:39.845
Knowing how this technology works

00:01:39.845 --> 00:01:43.845
is the first step on your journey to using it for good.

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:52.409
(upbeat music)
